    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13383" root="دورد" body-key="d">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دوّرهُ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدْوِيرٌ</span>, (S,) <i>He made it</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَوَّر</span> [i. e. <i>round,</i> meaning both <i>circular</i> and <i>spherical</i>]; (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ادارهُ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
4, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [One says also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دوّر الآرَآءَ فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرٍ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ادارها</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He turned about,</i> or <i>revolved,
thoughts,</i> or <i>ideas,</i> or <i>opinions, in his mind, respecting an affair:</i> like as one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَّبَ الفِكَرَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَى أَمْرٍ</span>.]

